They are named in a speech by Falstaff: 
{{cquote
|1="Let the sky rain [[potato]]es;<br />let it thunder to the tune of [[Greensleeves|Green-sleeves]],<br />hail kissing-comfits and snow '''eringoes''' [sea-holly],<br />let there come a tempest of provocation..."
|4=''Falstaff''
|5=Act 5, scene v, "The Merry Wives of Windsor", [[William Shakespeare]]
}}
